    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapist won't do anything. they'll just tell me to talk about my feelings and try to cope better, but how do you cope with a life that isn't even yours? it feels like i'm breathing through a straw. every day is just more of the same, just pretending. i don't want to \"reclaim\" myself through a bunch of talking... i just want the weight to stop. i want to finally be able to just... stop existing in this version of my life. i want an exit.",
